{"id":"70003ea1df88d933","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-substitution-functoriality-compat.md","title":"Compatibility statement","display":"thm-substitution-functoriality — Compatibility statement","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality-compat","aliases":["16-thm-substitution-functoriality-compat","16-thm--substitution-functoriality"],"display":"thm-substitution-functoriality — Compatibility statement","depends_on":["[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-substitution-functoriality-compat</span><span>16-thm--substitution-functoriality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-substitution-functoriality — Compatibility statement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> (带 cleavage 的纤维化)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:J\\to K\">\\(v:J\\to K\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{*},v^{*},(v\\circ u)^{*},\\operatorname{id}_{I}^{*}\">\\(u^{*},v^{*},(v\\circ u)^{*},\\operatorname{id}_{I}^{*}\\)</span> (重索引函子)</li>\n<li>固定 cleavage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>；重索引与两个规范自然同构采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a> 的分量构造及相干律。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}functoriality\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{id}_{I}^{*}\\cong\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\n\\land\\;(v\\circ u)^{*}\\cong u^{*}\\circ v^{*}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}functoriality\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{id}_{I}^{*}\\cong\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\n\\land\\;(v\\circ u)^{*}\\cong u^{*}\\circ v^{*}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>一般 cleavage 给自然同构，split fibration 才给严格等式；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 cleavage $\\kappa$；重索引与两个规范自然同构采用 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]] 的分量构造及相干律。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一般 cleavage 给自然同构，split fibration 才给严格等式；见 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"v:J\\to K","display":false},{"tex":"u^{*},v^{*},(v\\circ u)^{*},\\operatorname{id}_{I}^{*}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}functoriality\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{id}_{I}^{*}\\cong\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\n\\land\\;(v\\circ u)^{*}\\cong u^{*}\\circ v^{*}.","display":true}],"bytes":1119,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-456","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality-compat|thm-substitution-functoriality — Compatibility statement]]"}],"outgoing":["298460dd9013dccf"]}